DESCRIPTION:Category: Food & Beverage\, Member Mixer\nPrice: $65.00 per per
 son\nAvailability: 15 spots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://me
 mbers.thequinhouse.com/events/208334\n\nMake your Saturday a little more s
 erendipitous with a leisurely brunch hosted by The ‘Quin’s Membership 
 Team. Gather in Lunasol for an afternoon centered around good food\, easy 
 conversation\, and the opportunity to connect with fellow members\, whethe
 r meeting for the first time or discovering a familiar face in a new way.\
 n\nSettle in over a seasonal selection of chef-crafted entrées\, accompan
 ied by family-style favorites and classic brunch cocktails\, including mim
 osas and Bloody Marys. With a relaxed setting and plenty of time to linger
  around the table\, it’s an afternoon made for conversation\, connection
 \, and seeing where a little serendipity might lead.\n\nSpend your Saturda
 y at The ‘House unhurried\, social\, and best enjoyed in good company.\n
 \n*Tickets are $65 per person\, plus tax\, and are reserved for members on
 ly. Cancellations within 72 hours of the event\, or failure to attend\, wi
