 ted in part by The ’Quin House’s Art Curator\, Kate Chertavian. Bringi
 ng her expertise and passion for the arts to the table\, Kate will help gu
 ide conversations that may explore everything from The ’Quin’s own art
  collection to the broader world of art and culture\, inviting fresh persp
 ectives and meaningful exchanges along the way.\n\nOver a beautifully cura
 ted three-course dinner with expertly paired wines\, members will have the
  opportunity to share stories\, exchange ideas\, and get to know one anoth
 er beyond the everyday. Settle in for an evening where engaging dialogue\,
